 "address_zh": "河源市东源县新港镇港中路17号万绿湖风景区",
 "address_en": "Wanlv Lake Scenic Area, No. 17, Gangzhong Road, Xingang Town, Dongyuan County, Heyuan City",
 "address_en_source": "machine_translation",
 "category": "natural",
 "category_zh": "自然风光",
 "category_en": "Natural scenery",
 "intro_zh": "万绿湖风景区位于广东省河源市东源县境内，距广州200公里，距深圳180公里，是粤港澳大湾区的后花园，因处处是绿，四季皆绿而得名。万绿湖水质常年保持国家一类地表水标准，水域面积370平方公里，蓄水量约139亿立方米，有360多个绿色岛屿。万绿湖自1995年开发旅游，目前开发的景点有万绿湖、水月湾、龙凤岛、镜花缘、客家风情馆、万绿谷，面积共有11.5平方公里。",
 "intro_en": "Wanlv Lake Scenic Area is located in Dongyuan County, Heyuan City, Guangdong Province, 200 kilometers away from Guangzhou and 180 kilometers away from Shenzhen. It is the back garden of the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area. It is named because it is green everywhere and is green all year round. The water quality of Wanlu Lake maintains the national first-class surface water standard all year round. It has a water area of ​​370 square kilometers, a water storage capacity of approximately 13.9 billion cubic meters, and more than 360 green islands. Wanlv Lake has been developing tourism since 1995. The currently developed attractions include Wanlv Lake, Shuiyue Bay, Longfeng Island, Jinghuayuan, Hakka Customs Museum and Wanlu Valley, covering a total area of ​​11.5 square kilometers.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
